    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"difficult time\" though. it's everything. i spent twenty years building this life and now it's just... erased. how am i supposed to \"find a new path\" when there's nothing left to build on? there is no version of me that exists without the career. the version that's left is just a mistake.",
